<title>MALAYSIA: MALAYSIA HO WAH GENTING SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>MALAYSIA HO WAH GENTING SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of transportation company Ho Wah Genting Bhd were suspended from trading on Tuesday, a Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange (KLSE) official said.</p>
<p>The official said the suspension was on a request from the company.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Ho Wah Genting makes passenger buses. it is also involved in timber-related products like furniture and civil construction.</p>
